  "observations": [
    "All 21 current pinning originals were individually inspected, including complete source/read/replacement messages, held controls, backup isolation and normal restart.",
    "All six pinning light/dark 100/125/150 keyboard/error pairs show complete blue button outlines and whole errors.",
    "All 33 current snapshot originals were individually inspected. Six save keyboard/error pairs and six restore keyboard/error pairs show whole feedback, focus outlines and restore footer controls.",
    "Saved, restarted, repaired and quit-drained views show complete snapshot rows; corrupt read and replaced receipt messages are visible.",
    "At 150 percent upper metadata and lower navigation require vertical scrolling; no horizontal overflow was observed."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The other 142 selected originals are retained and are not counted as visual review in this round.",
    "The initial existing-target restore-error image does not show a blue keyboard outline; the six explicit restore keyboard cases provide that evidence.",
    "Earlier intermittent native timing/focus failures remain separately retained with unestablished exact causes."
  ],
  "scope": "Visual review of the current 345-check source-native snapshot integration. Cleanup, full reference adoption, installed/portable distribution and hosted release remain separate."
